2026-11-12 17:27:00,329 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **2. Lack of Operational Execution Evidence**
2026-11-12 17:27:00,329 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - Searches for CCleaner/Eraser with **zero evidence** they were installed or executed
